            "out": 320
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "final",
          "text": "It doesn't work with your balances as they stand.\n\n- **2026:** you'd need 8 leave days (21–24 and 28–31 Dec), but you only have 5. That's 3 days short.\n- **2027:** you'd need 5 leave days (4–8 Jan), and you have 28, so that's fine. Neujahr (1 Jan) is a public holiday and uses no leave.\n\nThe total is 13 leave days. Christmas Day (Fri 25 Dec) is a public holiday and 26 Dec falls on a Saturday, so neither uses leave.\n\nI can check alternative dates that fit within your 5 remaining 2026 days if you'd like.",
          "ms": 6058,
          "llm_calls": 2
        }
      ]
    }
